      "mergedPostDetails": "1. Go to Settings > User Interface.\n\n2. Set Notification Mode to Verbose.\n\n3. Enable \"Show Join Notifications\" and \"Show Leave Notifications\".\n\n4. Turn OFF \"Only Show Friend Join/Leave/Portal Notifications\".\n\n5. Join a public instance that already has several players in it.\n\n6. As soon as the world finishes loading, the HUD is flooded with join\n\n   notifications for every player who was already in the instance.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1912] Join notifications spam on world load",
